Krmelin — Third-Party Notices and Attributions
================================================

Krmelin is an independent, clean-room project inspired by the concept
pioneered by Tomáš Kohout's OSTRAJava (https://github.com/tkohout/OSTRAJava).
No source code from OSTRAJava is used, copied, or derived. Some keyword
choices are affectionate nods to design discussions in that project's issue
tracker. Krmelin is not endorsed by its author.

The dialect vocabulary used in Krmelin keywords is drawn from publicly
documented ostravština / lašské nářečí (Lach dialect) sources and is part of
the natural-language public domain.

